      "text": "Figure 2.3. 'DPI-H Architecture Design Principles': a blue semicircular fan of ten segments, each with an icon, around the title, and a short definition beside each: Governance, Open Standards, Interoperability, Sustainability, Modularity, Local Capacity, Equity and Inclusion, Data Ownership, Access and Control, Trust and Security, and Ethics.",
